;
; How Cupel files one simulation run in MYRA (cupel_rules.h CR7): the
; run's number, the model it ran, the steps it took, its energy at the end
; and how far that drifted from the start (in the model's fixed-point
; units), and 1 when its bounds halted it. Retort's ^ZXRETORT holds the
; same run as a contestant (retort.run_record_ok); this holds its physics.
^ZXCUPELRUN(run:i3) = model:i2! ^ steps:i7! ^ energy:i18! ^ drift:i18! ^ halted:i1!
